raw_json:
{"skill": "Function of Sentence", "difficulty": "Easy", "question": "In the passage below, the author introduces different reasons behind the shift in dietary habits in modern populations.

Recently, researchers have observed a trend in which individuals from various communities are shifting to plant-based diets. _This shift is driven by several factors, including growing awareness of environmental impacts associated with industrial farming and an increased focus on health and personal fitness._ To facilitate this change, numerous organizations have promoted educational campaigns highlighting the benefits of a plant-centric food system.

Which choice best describes the function of the underlined sentence in the context of the paragraph?", "choices": ["A) It provides examples of the specific methods used to support new dietary practices.", "B) It identifies the principal motivations behind the behavioral change described.", "C) It offers contrasting perspectives on the dietary trend mentioned in the text.", "D) It forecasts the future effects of the observed shift on global food industries."], "answer": "B", "explanation": "The underlined sentence functions to clarify the reasons for the transition in dietary habits by describing motivations such as environmental concerns and health consciousness. This explanation frames the discussion provided in the rest of the paragraph, connecting the observed behavior with its underlying causes. Choices A, C, and D misinterpret the role or content of the underlined sentence in the text."}

